title: Genesis 21 – The Bondwoman and the Freewoman
description: A verse-by-verse study of Genesis 21: Isaac born of the promise, Ishmael mocking and the bondwoman cast out, the allegory of Galatians 4, liberty in Christ against the bondage of the law, Hagar's well in the wilderness, and Abraham's covenant with Abimelech at Beersheba.
output: lessons/genesis/genesis-21-the-bondwoman-and-the-freewoman.html
context: Genesis 21

# Genesis series pattern (Genesis 1-5). Slide text is the author's own sentences from the Genesis 21 study (posts
